### Admin Management API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Prerequisites:
### - Backend running on port 8080
### - User with ROLE_ADMIN logged in
### - Access token available in cookies (HTTP-only)

### ===================== USER MANAGEMENT =====================

### Create a new user (Admin only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
?username=newuser&email=newuser@example.com&password=SecurePass123!&roles=THEMATICIAN,USER
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json

### Update an existing user (use ObjectId from GET request)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/{{userId}}
?username=updateduser&email=updated@example.com&roles=THEMATICIAN
Content-Type: application/json

### Reset a user's password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/reset-password
?newPassword=NewSecurePassword123!
Content-Type: application/json

### Lock a user account (disable)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/true
Content-Type: application/json

### Unlock a user account (enable)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/false
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ===================== ROLE MANAGEMENT =====================

### Get all roles
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/roles
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a new role
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleName": "CUSTOM_ROLE"
}

### Get role by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/roles/CUSTOM_ROLE
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete a role
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/roles/CUSTOM_ROLE
Content-Type: application/json

### ===================== CONFIGURATION MANAGEMENT =====================

### Get all manageable configuration properties
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/config/manageable
Content-Type: application/json

### Update a configuration property
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/config/manageable
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "app.name",
  "value": "Satellite Platform - New Name"
}

### Reset a configuration property to default (null value)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/config/manageable
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "app.name",
  "value": null
}

### ===================== AUDIT LOGS =====================

### Get latest audit logs (defaults to 100 lines)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audit/latest
Content-Type: application/json

### Get latest N audit logs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audit/latest?lines=50
Content-Type: application/json

### Filter audit logs by username
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audit/latest?username=admin&lines=50
Content-Type: application/json

### Filter audit logs by action
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audit/latest?action=LOGIN_SUCCESS&lines=100
Content-Type: application/json

### Get audit logs for a specific date (yyyy-MM-dd)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audit/by-date/2025-05-03
Content-Type: application/json

### Get audit logs for a date range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audit/by-range?startDate=2025-05-01&endDate=2025-05-03
Content-Type: application/json

### Filter by username and action on a specific date
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audit/by-date/2025-05-03?username=admin&action=LOGIN_SUCCESS
Content-Type: application/json

### List available audit log dates
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audit/available-dates
Content-Type: application/json

### ===================== ADMIN SIGNUP REQUESTS =====================

### Get pending admin signup requests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/signup-requests/pending
Content-Type: application/json

### Approve an admin signup request (creates user with ADMIN role)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/signup-requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

### Reject an admin signup request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/signup-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json

### ===================== NOTES =====================
###
### 1. Replace {{userId}} and {{requestId}} with actual ObjectIds from responses
### 2. All endpoints require ROLE_ADMIN (enforced by @PreAuthorize)
### 3. Tokens are sent via HTTP-only cookies automatically
### 4. Audit logs support filtering by username and action
### 5. Configuration updates accept null to reset to defaults
### 6. User roles must exist before assigning to users
